<title>FINLAND: HELIBOR INTEREST RATES STEADY TO LOWER.</title>
<headline>HELIBOR INTEREST RATES STEADY TO LOWER.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helibor interest rates were steady or lower at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Wednesday. The three-month rate was steady at 3.08 percent.</p>
<p>				  November 27 fix     November 26 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor		   3.01 pct		3.01 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor		   3.04 pct		3.04 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor		   3.08 pct		3.08 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor		   3.20 pct		3.20 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor		   3.30 pct		3.32 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor		  3.40 pct		3.43 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 240</p>
